        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 58:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kok ma tek, kud ikwer, ting’ dwendi calu agwara, man iyer ni dhanu para pi gondri migi, man ni ot pa Yakobo pi dubo migi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.58.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.58.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 58:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ento giyenya ku ba rupiny ku ba rupiny, man anyong’a negogi kum ng’eyo yo para: calu thek ma timo bedopwe, man m’uweko lembapoka pa Mungu migi ngo, gipenjo lembapoka ma pwe i bang’a; anyong’a negogi kum eoro ceng’ni Mungu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.58.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.58.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 58:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nedi wakwiro cam man ineno ngo? giwacu; nedi wasendo ng’eyong’ec mwa, man iparu pire ngo? Nen, i ceng’ mi kwirocam mu wunwang’u anyong’a mu ma dhe, man wusendo jutic mu ceke. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.58.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.58.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 58:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nen, wukwiro cam mi yakni ku piem, man kara wugoi kud adhong mi dubo: wukwiro cam i ceng’ maeni ngo kara wuketh dwendwu winjre malu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.58.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.58.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 58:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Afoyo wadi kwirocam maeno? en e ceng’ ma ni dhanu ya esend ie ng’eyong’ec pare? En e mi kulo wie calu usi, man mi pedho gonia ku vuru i there? ibilwong’o maeni kwirocam, man ceng’ ma jukwiro ni Yehova? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.58.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.58.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 58:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwirocam m’afoyo e eni ngo: ya jugony twic mi dubo, jugony twic mi mberembere, man jugony ju ma jusendogi, man nia jutur mberembere ceke kubang’e kubang’e? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.58.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.58.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 58:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "MAT.25.34"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mt 25:34",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "En e nia jupok kwen peri ni ju ma kec unegogi ngo, man nia ikel jucan ma jubayu i ot peri? kinde m’ineno ng’atu ma muneru, ya iume; man nia kud ipond ni juot peri ma dhe? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.58.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.58.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 58:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "E der peri bilund dhenjre calu rupiny, man cang peri biwodhre pio; bedopwe peri de bicidho i weng’i; dwong’ pa Yehova bibedo ni jamgwok i ng’ei. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.58.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.58.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 58:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ibilund lwong’o, e Yehova biloko lembe; ibiywak, e ebiwacu kumae, Anuti.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.58.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.58.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 58:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tek ikabu mberembere cen kud i kindi, ku rieyo lwet, man yero rac; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.58.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.58.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 58:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "man tek imio gin ma ng’eyong’ec peri yenyo ni ju ma kec unegogi, man iyeng’o ng’eyong’ec ma jusendo: e der peri bilund yabre i mudho, man paru pi jo ngo peri bibedo calu dieceng’; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.58.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.58.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 58:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "e Yehova bitelo wii thiri thiri, man ebikwio ng’eyong’ec peri i ka m’uthwo, man ebidwoko cogoni tek; e ibibedo calu podho ma jukwoyo pi i wie, man calu kulo mi pi, ma pige dwono ngo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.58.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.58.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 58:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man ju ma gi nyikwei gibigomo kar uvuru ma con; ibiting’o thepiny ni dhanum’utuk dupa; man jubilwong’i kumae, Jayik ka m’utur, man, Jadwok yo mi bedo i ie.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.58.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.58.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 58:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.58.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.58.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 58:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tek iloko tiendi cen ku ba sabatu, ku ba timo gin ma nyayu mutoro i ii ceng’ ma leng’ para; man ilwong’ ceng’ sabatu anyong’a, man leng’ pa Yehova dwong’; man ibiyunge, m’itimo yo peri giri ngo, kadi m’inwang’u mutoro peri giri ngo, kadi m’iweco lembe peri giri ngo: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.58.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.58.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 58:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ibilund ketho anyong’a negi ni kum Yehova; man abiketho iwotho ku ka ma malu m’i ng’om; man abikeki kud aba pa Yakobo ma kwaru: kum dhu Yehova yero maeni.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.58.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.58.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
